  "body": "We put \"fetch params\" in the Infrastructure section temporarily, but I think it all needs to move to the Fetching section.\r\n\r\nI think it should first have a \"Fetching miscellaneous\" section that contains \"fetch params\", \"fetch controller\", etc. And then a section \"Fetch algorithm\" that is essentially what \"Fetching\" starts with now.\r\n\r\nAnd then ideally we'd have a \"Fetching introduction\" section at some point (either named or implicit) at the start that gives a brief overview and perhaps has a diagram with the control flow.\r\n\r\n(See #1329 for context.)",
